{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How far will you go to keep your crown?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitchforks and Daggers is a <strong>branching court politics drama</strong> where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As King Henry of Elander, you must navigate treacherous lords, scheming family members, and angry peasants- all while trying to secure your kingdom\u2019s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tightly woven, <strong>highly replayable</strong> narrative where each playthrough reveals different paths and endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every action has consequences</strong>, shaping the fate of your rule and the land you govern. Consult your court, weigh your options, and decide carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make difficult decisions:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/2226cc9f5d0799cbc30e1957a31a0ad1.poster.avif?t=1764413745\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/2226cc9f5d0799cbc30e1957a31a0ad1.webm?t=1764413745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/2226cc9f5d0799cbc30e1957a31a0ad1.mp4?t=1764413745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply <strong>branching narrative</strong> with multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A web of <strong>political intrigue</strong>, betrayal, and war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-stakes choices that <strong>alter the story</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for <strong>replayability</strong>- discover fresh outcomes each time you rule.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be prepared to fail:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/590318251eaf515cf294c4231e9245ba.poster.avif?t=1764413745\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/590318251eaf515cf294c4231e9245ba.webm?t=1764413745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/590318251eaf515cf294c4231e9245ba.mp4?t=1764413745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Henry has no heir, his beloved wife cannot bear children. Meanwhile, his uncle, King Harold of Ervin, challenges his claim to the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom teeters on the brink of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape the fate of Elander. Will you secure your legacy, or lose everything?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Elander:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/e5549d616e74e00d91469e0a1c5ff602.poster.avif?t=1764413745\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/e5549d616e74e00d91469e0a1c5ff602.webm?t=1764413745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/e5549d616e74e00d91469e0a1c5ff602.mp4?t=1764413745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wester's Ally","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/9ecbede67a5be1b007c64d582d2ec4dece769b35.jpg"},{"name":"I Changed My Mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/d8d0bf73ec04d6e31180ed7f6311474265fd2f2b.jpg"},{"name":"Noble Rescue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/771830c88eb2808121b5fbd04b91a7e8a0ba43f5.jpg"},{"name":"Friend of the People","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/4c3495932bc4a518e18ba46b6b61afd98ce2719c.jpg"},{"name":"Traitor Defeated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/b4bb81f8d6490d6a89dcba31c77f5fd68f5fc29f.jpg"},{"name":"No Mercy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/19e3eaed088027d5c7b9862c465e0a080da41d01.jpg"},{"name":"Angry Pitchforks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/29db1822facf2b8908010bfc385e2f1d08bafec6.jpg"},{"name":"My Own Flesh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/048865d34d851dfa2fc9c357fcdc5881eb6b438e.jpg"},{"name":"Off With Heads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/2c0b503a78eee70440d64c39c1a8489392f84a6c.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019m Sorry Brother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2762740/d086c452e293f58bbc2092068cac758e763a1176.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2762740?t=1764413745","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764413745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/18bbdc04ec3bc67f1b481305f93e9d3bfcb65f19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764413745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/18bbdc04ec3bc67f1b481305f93e9d3bfcb65f19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764413745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"As the king you can behead, hang, or poison other characters. The death animations contain pixelated blood.\r\nSome npc's bodies will appear with pixelated blood.\r\nImplied sex and fertility in conversations."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How far will you go to keep your crown?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitchforks and Daggers is a <strong>branching court politics drama</strong> where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As King Henry of Elander, you must navigate treacherous lords, scheming family members, and angry peasants- all while trying to secure your kingdom\u2019s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tightly woven, <strong>highly replayable</strong> narrative where each playthrough reveals different paths and endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every action has consequences</strong>, shaping the fate of your rule and the land you govern. Consult your court, weigh your options, and decide carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make difficult decisions:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/2226cc9f5d0799cbc30e1957a31a0ad1.poster.avif?t=1764413745\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762740/extras/222